``On the other hand, precision scores suggest that the super-ensemble tends to overestimate species occurrence. The super-ensemble provides very accurate predictions for black spruce and white birch (precision {\textgreater} 0.90) but tends to significantly overestimate the occurrence of larch, yellow birch, red maple, and white spruce (precision {\textless} 0.42).'' ()


